 and service apartments. In addition, the company engages in the provision of advertising, media, office, administrative, and information technology products and services. The company was formerly known as Reliance Pacific Berhad and changed its name to Avillion Berhad in September 2017. Avillion Berhad was incorporated in 1992 and is based in Kuala Lumpur, Malaysia.","zh":"Avillion Berhad 是一家投资控股公司，业务涉及酒店、房地产和旅游，在马来西亚、香港、新加坡和印度尼西亚运营。公司原名 Reliance Pacific Berhad，于2017年9月更名，1992年成立，总部位于马来西亚吉隆坡。","lines":["酒店管理：从事酒店和度假村管理，开发酒店、度假村及旅游相关项目，并运营水疗和健康中心。","物业管理：以及酒店套房和服务式公寓的管理服务。","旅游业务：提供旅游服务和旅游行程。","支持服务与集团管理：提供广告媒体服务、行政服务、信息技术产品和服务，以及酒店、房地产和旅游行业的管理与咨询顾问服务。","码头俱乐部运营：运营包括停泊设施在内的码头俱乐部。"],"lines_en":["Hotel Management: Engages in hotel and resort management, development of hotels, resorts and tourism-related projects, and operation of spas and health centres.","Property Management: Involves property development, investment and holding, and management services for hotel suites and service apartments.","Travel: Provides travel services and tours.","Support Services and Group Management: Offers advertising and media services, administrative services, IT products and services, and management and advisory consultancy services in hotel, property and tourism industries.","Marina Club Operations: Operates marina clubs including berthing facilities."]}}